  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Affordable Housing Finance Project - Financial Literacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Palestinian Affordable Housing Finance Project - Financial Literacy is a component of Support to improve access to mortgages for affordable housing in the Occupied Palestinian Territories reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;742,641. It works in the following sector(s): Education/training in banking and financial services, Financial policy and administrative management.</narrative>
